cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If DR-TBAtlas supported your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "DR-TBAtlas: an interactive web-based interface for visual exploration of the WHO Mycobacterium tuberculosis drug resistance catalogue"
abstract: >-
  DR-TBAtlas is a web-based genomic explorer for Mycobacterium tuberculosis that
  links genomic regions, variant coordinates and sequences with the WHO
  catalogue of mutations associated with drug resistance.
authors:
